#cccccccccccccc#
#.x..........y.#
#.xx....*....y.#
#......cc......#
#......cc......#
#######cc#######
place MARKET_TENT 2 2
place MARKET_TENT 6 2
place MARKET_TENT 10 2
warp 7 11 MINE 11 6 up
warp 8 11 MINE 11 6 up
